, Precedence Graphs & Strict 2PL.", "hours": 3.0, "estimated_hours": 3.0, "tasks": [{"id": "dbms-d6-t1", "text": "Review visual notes & formulas for ACID, Precedence Graphs & Strict 2PL", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d6-t2", "text": "Solve 5 active-recall problems on ACID, Precedence Graphs & Strict 2PL", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d6-t3", "text": "Write 1 timed exam rubric answer (Practice & Drills)", "duration_min": 60}]}, {"day": 7, "id": "dbms-day-7", "title": "Day 7: ARIES Write-Ahead Logging & Crash Recovery", "phase": "Practice & Drills", "priority": "Core", "focus": "ARIES Write-Ahead Logging & Crash Recovery", "description": "Review visual notes & formulas, solve 5 recall problems, and complete 1 timed rubric drill on ARIES Write-Ahead Logging & Crash Recovery.", "hours": 3.0, "estimated_hours": 3.0, "tasks": [{"id": "dbms-d7-t1", "text": "Review visual notes & formulas for ARIES Write-Ahead Logging & Crash Recovery", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d7-t2", "text": "Solve 5 active-recall problems on ARIES Write-Ahead Logging & Crash Recovery", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d7-t3", "text": "Write 1 timed exam rubric answer (Practice & Drills)", "duration_min": 60}]}, {"day": 8, "id": "dbms-day-8", "title": "Day 8: ER Modeling & Relational Algebra", "phase": "Practice & Drills", "priority": "Core", "focus": "ER Modeling & Relational Algebra", "description": "Review visual notes & formulas, solve 5 recall problems, and complete 1 timed rubric drill on ER Modeling & Relational Algebra.", "hours": 3.0, "estimated_hours": 3.0, "tasks": [{"id": "dbms-d8-t1", "text": "Review visual notes & formulas for ER Modeling & Relational Algebra", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d8-t2", "text": "Solve 5 active-recall problems on ER Modeling & Relational Algebra", "duration_min": 60}, {"id": "dbms-d8-t3", "text": "Write 1 timed exam rubric answer (Practice & Drills)", "duration_min": 60}]}, {"day": 9, "id": "dbms-day-9", "title": "Day 9: Functional Dependen